{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resistanceDistance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"target","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1e-10, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SB","text":"BinaryFloatingPoint","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Conjugate gradients on the Laplacian grounded at ","type":"text"},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", from 0, until the residual’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Euclidean norm is at most ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (relative to the right-hand side, which has norm 1),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or, on a weight spread that puts that below rounding, until the true residual stops","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"improving. Jacobi preconditioned for 300 iterations, then by a modified incomplete Cholesky","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"factor in maximum-spanning-tree order. O((n + m) √κ) time; about 9 n words, and O(n + m) for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the factor when it is built.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"type":"text","text":" gives the conductance of the edge at each position, read once per position (every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position, also outside the component); a weight of 0 is no edge."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are vertices of the graph, every weight is finite and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nonnegative, "},{"code":"tolerance > 0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is at least 1."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"NoConvergence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" after ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conjugate-gradient iterations (one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matrix–vector product each; 20,000 + 2n when nil), with that count and the residual’s norm","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"relative to the right-hand side’s. No input has reached the default limit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"measurements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory","doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/resistanceDistance(from:to:weight:tolerance:maxIterations:)-4cudc","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spectralgraphtheory\/graphprotocols\/graph\/resistancedistance(from:to:weight:tolerance:maxiterations:)-4cudc"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"The resistance distance between ","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":